12. Complete Trading Psychology Workflow
1. Prepare mentally before the market opens.
2. Define the trading plan and risk limits.
3. Enter only when the predefined conditions are met.
4. Accept uncertainty and follow exit rules.
5. Avoid revenge trading and impulsive decisions.
6. Record decisions and emotions in a journal.
7. Review mistakes without judging yourself only by profit or loss.
8. Improve one behavioral weakness at a time.
